---

❌ I am very like novels.

✅ I really enjoy reading novels.

---

# Band 8+ Tip

When answering, don't just say **what** you read—explain **why**.

### ❌ Basic
> I like programming books.

### ✅ Band 8+
> I particularly enjoy reading programming books because they help me stay up to date with the latest technologies and improve my problem-solving skills. Since I work as a software engineer, I can often apply what I learn directly to real-world projects.

